  "reason": "Evidence: config_031 (scvi_n200, resnet50, avgpool, weighted) is the current best at 0.678 acc, clearly outperforming pca_n2000 (0.639) and scgpt (0.525) under identical settings. Multiprofile + avgpool + weighted fusion are well-supported. The only major untested dimension in this best-configuration context is the image encoder: only resnet50 has been used, while imagenet_vit_l remains unexplored. Image-only resnet50 was very weak (0.208), but in multimodal fusion it contributed meaningfully (0.591→0.639 with pca; 0.639→0.678 with scvi), suggesting the image branch carries complementary signal. Testing config_037 (scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, avgpool, weighted) directly asks whether a stronger, higher-capacity image encoder can further boost the multimodal pipeline beyond the current best. This is the highest-value next experiment because it exploits the strongest known configuration while probing the single largest unexplored design axis, and the result will inform whether further investment in image-side capacity is warranted."
}

